               PERFORM EXPAND-WITH-PROFITS-0007.
               PERFORM EXPAND-ROOF-TYPE-0008.
               PERFORM RECONCILE-POSTCODE-0009.
               PERFORM APPLY-POSTCODE-0010.
               PERFORM EXPAND-TAX-BAND-0011.
               PERFORM CHECK-MODEL-0012.
